{
  "about": "The launch video's cut (sample 1, English). entries: the timeline in order; a shot's in/out are seconds of its recording (trailer-out/shots/<shot>.mp4), a plate's card is drawn for `seconds`. cards: the text drawn by titles.html (index = trailer-out/cards/<n>.png); an entry's `cards` lay them over it from..to (seconds into the entry), faded `fade` s. music: pieces of assets/music over a run of entries (`entries`: [first, last], from `in` s into the piece). sfx: which game samples (src/audio/samples) each physics event kind sounds as; ambience: loops under each shot. Read by tools/trailer/assemble.py.",
